<< /Author (TDK Corporation) /CreationDate (D:20240402161525+09'00') /Creator (FrameMaker 16.0.5) /Keywords (TDK\nMLZ2012 type) /ModDate (D:20240402161525+09'00') /Producer (pikepdf 8.4.0) /Subject (The MLZ series include inductors for decoupling circuits that have top-class DC superimposition characteristics and low DC resistance., They are compatible with wide frequency band noise, from low to high frequency., H type products have a rated current that is equivalent to that of wound coils., W type products are the new standard type products that have both large current and low resistance., L type products have a resistance up to 60% lower than W type products., Operating temperature range: \20555 to +125°C \(including self-temperature rise\)) /Title (Inductors for decoupling circuits) >>
